# The manylinux image is built with the repository root as its context, because
# the stage that populates the conan cache copies the conanfiles and profiles
# out of it. Everything here is irrelevant to that and would only make the
# context slower to send -- build/ alone runs to several gigabytes.
#
# docker/ is deliberately NOT excluded: the image copies its vimrc from there.
build/
.git/
.github/
docs/
docs-src/
software-docs/
extern/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
